00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:35.510
So be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:40.030
I’ll talk more about the footage I think
we’ll see after I we get through SHIELD

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:41.030
craziness.

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:43.170
Careful for spoilers in case you haven’t
seen the episode.

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:44.340
Starting with Top 5 Moments,

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:47.969
Number 5 - HYDRA is trying to weaponize the
Obelisk

00:00:47.969 --> 00:00:51.620
That group in the beginning they were testing
it on were people with Ties to SHIELD.

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:52.620
They weren’t all SHIELD agents, but HYDRA
was using them as a test.

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:56.190
They used cells from the woman in the cafe
to try and reverse engineer the effects.

00:00:56.190 --> 00:01:02.249
There aren’t that many people that have
touched the obelisk, so when Kraken was talking

00:01:02.249 --> 00:01:04.769
about Tissue cells he was talking about her.

00:01:04.769 --> 00:01:10.160
Before shit went down, Simmons was probably
going to start working on Obelisk research.

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:14.535
There was actually a big Hell Cow Howard the
Duck easter egg when she was in the lab.

00:01:14.535 --> 00:01:16.290
They were talking about milk from a hell cow.

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:20.950
It’s a character named Bessie that appeared
in Giant Sized Man Thing Issue 5.

00:01:20.950 --> 00:01:23.980
The story goes that she was a regular cow.

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:29.370
Dracula drank her blood, she died, her farmer
buried her and 3 days later she rose as a

00:01:29.370 --> 00:01:30.370
vampire cow.

00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:33.710
So she’s a cow with humanoid vampire qualities.

00:01:33.710 --> 00:01:35.490
She had a crossover with Howard the Duck.

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:38.520
So that’s what the Bessie Hellcow Milk stuff
was about.

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:40.060
Number 4 - Raina Is In Trouble

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:42.060
I feel kind of bad for her character.

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:46.240
It’s the classic situation where the evil
temptress becomes sympathetic because she

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:50.110
gets mistreated by the villains she serves.

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:52.550
It’s like Mystique turning against Magneto.

00:01:52.550 --> 00:02:02.940
It just seems like they’re setting up Raina
as a double agent inside HYDRA.

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:07.950
She wants evolution and as we saw at the end.

00:02:07.950 --> 00:02:13.590
Kraken and Skye’s Father only care about
themselves.

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:16.129
Tiny Violins of course, she is a verified
scumbag.

00:02:16.129 --> 00:02:19.349
So of course she’s going to burn Team Coulson
in the end.

00:02:19.349 --> 00:02:22.590
She really is the Mystique of the series.

00:02:22.590 --> 00:02:27.209
Regardless of what battle lines are drawn.

00:02:27.209 --> 00:02:33.680
She’s just going to skip around the chess
board and escape at the end.

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:36.430
We did get a little teaser for her backstory.

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:38.590
Skye’s father did something to her.

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:41.611
It sounds like it was way more than just give
her a place to live and food to eat.

00:02:41.611 --> 00:02:44.050
Like he helped her attain some skills.

00:02:44.050 --> 00:02:48.810
She seems like she has low level passive mutant
abilities and she’s trying to unlock her

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:49.810
true potential.

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:56.540
Which just screams Inhumans to me.

00:02:56.540 --> 00:03:06.359
The Obelisk is an alien device, so it could
be what Marvel is using to represent Terrigen

00:03:06.359 --> 00:03:07.359
Crystals.

00:03:07.359 --> 00:03:12.560
If that’s the case, the map could be a map
to Attilan.

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:16.560
Number 3 - Coulson Comes Clean About the Alien
Markings

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:19.569
Based on the way he talked about the carvings
just coming out without him actively thinking

00:03:19.569 --> 00:03:20.569
about them.

00:03:20.569 --> 00:03:24.019
The carving is an unconscious thing, he doesn’t
think about what the map is supposed to look

00:03:24.019 --> 00:03:25.019
like.

00:03:25.019 --> 00:03:29.889
I’m thinking 2 possibilities Inhumans or
Guardians of The Galaxy.

00:03:29.889 --> 00:03:32.079
I’ll explain Inhumans first.

00:03:32.079 --> 00:03:36.540
The whole idea behind terragenesis is that
it unlocks something inside you that is hidden.

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:38.519
Or just strips away the shell.

00:03:38.519 --> 00:03:42.340
So if Coulson’s subconscious is forcibly
working it’s way to the surface it could

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:46.730
be an early stage of what happens when you
take in the terrigen mists.

00:03:46.730 --> 00:03:48.489
Not everyone survives them, sometimes the
mists kill people.

00:03:48.489 --> 00:03:50.879
The ones that survive become inhumans and
get crazy powers.

00:03:50.879 --> 00:03:55.950
It’s like a way of saying there is a brave
new world coming, not everyone is meant to

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:56.950
live in it.

00:03:56.950 --> 00:03:57.950
Like Garrett.

00:03:57.950 --> 00:04:02.209
Coulson said he thought Garrett wasn’t meant
to survive the Kree formula.

00:04:02.209 --> 00:04:06.169
Marvel is pretty convoluted when it comes
to who has the rights to what characters.

00:04:06.169 --> 00:04:11.120
I think they have the rights to Inhumans,
so they could do them if they wanted.

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:14.790
If that’s what’s going on, the map could
be a map to Attilan, the city of the inhumans

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:17.169
or it could be a genetic map.

00:04:17.169 --> 00:04:20.609
The other possibility with the carvings is
that it’s a literal map to something from

00:04:20.609 --> 00:04:22.479
the Guardians of The Galaxy stories.

00:04:22.479 --> 00:04:23.750
Like outer space map.

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:31.800
And Marvel is using Agents of SHIELD to link
those things to their earth based Marvel stories.

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:38.419
I think this is less likely, just because
James Gunn said Guardians 2 wasn’t adding

00:04:38.419 --> 00:04:43.919
any new human characters and he just wanted
it to be off in it’s own corner of the Marvel

00:04:43.919 --> 00:04:44.919
Universe.

00:04:44.919 --> 00:04:48.960
Meaning that Guardians stuff would not directly
overlap with the other Marvel Movie stuff.

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:50.090
So I’m 99 percent positive they’re not
going to do marvel in space.

00:04:50.090 --> 00:05:00.729
But regardless, I do think the Obelisk or
the Diviner is Kree in origin.

00:05:00.729 --> 00:05:03.220
Number 2 - Shit Goes Down at HYDRA

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:05.970
The standoff between Raina and Coulson was
actually pretty funny.

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:07.669
Coulson just not buying her shit.

00:05:07.669 --> 00:05:14.580
We knew that Mockingbird was going to be a
double agent, the promos pretty much explained

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:15.599
it last week.

00:05:15.599 --> 00:05:18.639
But seeing her go all Black Widow was awesome.

00:05:18.639 --> 00:05:21.180
Simmons is always pretty hilarious in situations
like that.

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:23.550
Which I think made it work better.

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:26.139
I don’t like SHIELD as much when it takes
itself too seriously.

00:05:26.139 --> 00:05:29.990
It’s a lot more fun to play the Simmons
lols off the crazy Bashki villain.

00:05:29.990 --> 00:05:31.440
It’s like a cross between Borne Trilogy
parkour and Avengers Humor.

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:34.819
In real life, the actors were sitting right
next to each other live-tweeting the episode.

00:05:34.819 --> 00:05:38.509
I always laugh a little when you see villains
and heroes on shows just chilling out like

00:05:38.509 --> 00:05:43.710
bros in real life.

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:47.860
The rooftop stunt was really cool too with
the quintjet reveal.

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:51.640
They keep giving simmons crazier and crazier
stunts, so I’m interested to see if she

00:05:51.640 --> 00:06:03.659
and Fitz get a big action moment like this
now that they’ve been reunited.

00:06:03.659 --> 00:06:23.180
That was big, them being in the same room
together but it ended up feeling like a downer.

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:32.349
I’m sure they’ll slowly get back to fitzsimmons
by the middle of the season.

00:06:32.349 --> 00:06:38.150
and my Number 1 Moment - Mockingbird joins
the Team

00:06:38.150 --> 00:06:46.970
I feel like back when they announced she was
going to be on the episode and Hunter went

00:06:46.970 --> 00:06:52.069
on and on about his ex-wife we all wondered
if it might be Mockingbird.

00:06:52.069 --> 00:06:56.930
It just seemed like it would be too sweet.

00:06:56.930 --> 00:07:01.280
I was so happy when they confirmed it, it
just means the team will get to have that

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:06.669
much more fun giving Hunter, admittedly a
douche bag, a bunch of shit about it.

00:07:06.669 --> 00:07:11.129
Based on her rapport with the team, she goes
way back with most of the older members of

00:07:11.129 --> 00:07:12.129
the team.

00:07:12.129 --> 00:07:15.199
The reference to her hair was just a nod to
Mockingbird in the comics being Blonde.

00:07:15.199 --> 00:07:17.580
Also adrianne palicki was blonde on Friday
Night Lights.

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:20.680
So you could either take it as a wink to the
comics or to that.

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:21.680
Palicki did an interview recently where she
said there was potential for her character

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:22.680
to cross over into the movies.

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:23.680
It’s too late for her to show up in Avengers
2, they’ve already finished the film.

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:24.680
But she’ll probably cameo in one of the
phase 3 movies.

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:25.680
Captain America 3 would be the most likely
since those are always feature a lot of SHIELD

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:26.680
characters.

00:07:26.680 --> 00:07:27.680
Just as a bonus I wanted to talk about Skye’s
Dad, he didn’t really fit into any of my

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:29.840
other moments, but he’s a huge character.

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:31.469
Very clearly affected by the Obelisk.

00:07:31.469 --> 00:07:34.719
I’m guessing he studied it for a long time
and was changed.

00:07:34.719 --> 00:07:40.240
We didn’t see him transform or anything
but it did seem like he had super strength.

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:44.509
Skye called him a monster, so don’t be surprised
if he physically turns into a monster by the

00:07:44.509 --> 00:07:45.629
end of his arc.

00:07:45.629 --> 00:07:48.690
I’m hoping he makes it past the mid-season
finale.

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:50.720
The Garrett character made it through a whole
season.

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:53.810
So right now I’m thinking of him as the
new Garrett.

00:07:53.810 --> 00:08:25.620
Kraken is the big bad, but think about HYDRA
this year being a version of masters of evil.

00:08:25.620 --> 00:10:21.410
With a couple top tier villains.

